{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"106338","commit":"8b72975a3eefb4aa14c5d05fb55bffc5fc218f69","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The logic in the `build` method sets the `store` parameter to true if it is not set, the source is synthetic, and there are no suitable keyword multi-fields. However, this change does not account for cases where setting `store` to true might have unintended side effects, such as increased storage requirements or performance degradation. Additionally, the removal of `b.field(\"store\", true)` in the `example` method and conditional addition based on `explicitlyStoreTextField` introduces a potential inconsistency, as there is no default storage behavior anymore.  \n[Symptom] -\u003e [Technical Cause] -\u003e [Systemic Risk]: The method sets `store` to true without considering potential side effects and the new code only stores the field if `explicitlyStoreTextField` is true -\u003e No evaluation of the impact on storage and performance, and no default storage behavior -\u003e Potential resource inefficiency or unintended data loss leading to degraded system performance.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/TextFieldMapperTests.java-SRC-DELETION-56603-56647-MethodInvocation","path":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/TextFieldMapperTests.java","srcDst":"SRC","content":"b.field(\"type\", \"text\").field(\"store\", true)","nodeType":"DELETION","treeType":"MethodInvocation","descendantSimpleNames":["b","field","field"],"startLine":1141,"startLineOffset":28,"endLine":1141,"endLineOffset":72,"length":45,"subs":[{"startLine":1141,"startLineOffset":58,"endLine":1141,"endLineOffset":71,"length":14},{"startLine":1141,"startLineOffset":28,"endLine":1141,"endLineOffset":51,"length":24},{"startLine":1141,"startLineOffset":28,"endLine":1141,"endLineOffset":51,"length":24}]},{"id":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/TextFieldMapperTests.java-DST-ADDITION-56716-56833-IfSt